<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><ttm:agent type="other" xml:id="v2"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Mirror (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Secret Sky 2021 (Live)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1864859257"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:43.777"><div begin="00:36.657" end="05:43.777"><p begin="00:36.657" end="00:42.374" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:36.657" end="00:36.922">Some</span><span begin="00:36.922" end="00:37.520">times</span> <span begin="00:40.689" end="00:40.933">the</span> <span begin="00:40.933" end="00:41.011">in</span><span begin="00:41.011" end="00:41.121">ner</span> <span begin="00:41.121" end="00:41.547">voice</span> <span begin="00:41.547" end="00:41.612">is</span> <span begin="00:41.612" end="00:41.700">en</span><span begin="00:41.700" end="00:41.876">cou</span><span begin="00:41.876" end="00:42.045">ra</span><span begin="00:42.045" end="00:42.374">ging</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有些时候 内心的声音是那样鼓舞人心</span></p><p begin="00:44.497" end="00:47.395" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:44.497" end="00:44.597">Cal</span><span begin="00:44.597" end="00:44.804">ling</span> <span begin="00:44.804" end="00:44.919">for</span> <span begin="00:44.919" end="00:45.150">you</span> <span begin="00:45.150" end="00:45.252">to</span> <span begin="00:45.252" end="00:45.485">run</span> <span begin="00:45.485" end="00:45.839">those</span> <span begin="00:45.839" end="00:46.105">fi</span><span begin="00:46.105" end="00:46.315">nal</span> <span begin="00:46.315" end="00:46.567">few</span> <span begin="00:46.567" end="00:47.395">yards</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">呼唤着你坚持跑过最后的那几码路程</span></p><p begin="00:47.395" end="00:48.846" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:47.395" end="00:47.613">You're</span> <span begin="00:47.613" end="00:47.686">near</span><span begin="00:47.686" end="00:47.784">ly</span> <span begin="00:47.784" end="00:48.205">there</span> <span begin="00:48.205" end="00:48.433">keep</span> <span begin="00:48.433" end="00:48.660">go</span><span begin="00:48.660" end="00:48.846">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:48.846" end="00:50.896"><span begin="00:48.846" end="00:49.160">(Keep</span> <span begin="00:49.160" end="00:49.351">go</span><span begin="00:49.351" end="00:49.534">ing</span> <span begin="00:49.534" end="00:49.821">Keep</span> <span begin="00:49.821" end="00:50.014">Go</span><span begin="00:50.014" end="00:50.197">ing</span> <span begin="00:50.197" end="00:50.574">Keep</span> <span begin="00:50.574" end="00:50.713">Go</span><span begin="00:50.713" end="00:50.896">ing)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就快胜利了 继续下去 坚持到底</span></p><p begin="00:50.896" end="00:53.229" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:50.896" end="00:51.013">It</span> <span begin="00:51.013" end="00:51.226">will</span> <span begin="00:51.226" end="00:51.748">all</span> <span begin="00:51.748" end="00:51.914">be</span> <span begin="00:51.914" end="00:52.138">o</span><span begin="00:52.138" end="00:52.500">kay</span> <span begin="00:52.500" end="00:52.593">in</span> <span begin="00:52.593" end="00:52.705">the</span> <span begin="00:52.705" end="00:53.229">end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">最终 一切都会好起来的</span></p><p begin="01:11.511" end="01:14.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="01:11.511" end="01:11.766">Well</span> <span begin="01:11.766" end="01:12.132">you</span> <span begin="01:12.132" end="01:12.624">were</span> <span begin="01:12.624" end="01:12.859">the</span> <span begin="01:12.859" end="01:13.646">af</span><span begin="01:13.646" end="01:13.890">ter</span><span begin="01:13.890" end="01:14.936">math</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是那场浩劫的余波</span></p><p begin="01:15.784" end="01:19.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:15.784" end="01:16.019">Of</span> <span begin="01:16.019" end="01:16.589">e</span><span begin="01:16.589" end="01:17.122">very</span> <span begin="01:17.122" end="01:17.952">judg</span><span begin="01:17.952" end="01:19.009">ment</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">被人非议的创伤难以抚平</span></p><p begin="01:20.047" end="01:23.326" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:20.047" end="01:20.334">So</span> <span begin="01:20.334" end="01:20.759">cold</span> <span begin="01:20.759" end="01:21.138">by</span> <span begin="01:21.138" end="01:21.389">the</span> <span begin="01:21.389" end="01:22.189">sweat</span> <span begin="01:22.189" end="01:23.326">that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">冷汗浸透你的衣衫</span></p><p begin="01:24.333" end="01:26.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:24.333" end="01:24.568">You'll</span> <span begin="01:24.568" end="01:24.990">waste</span> <span begin="01:24.990" end="01:25.399">a</span><span begin="01:25.399" end="01:26.141">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就此颓废堕落</span></p><p begin="01:28.535" end="01:31.952" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:28.535" end="01:28.643">And</span> <span begin="01:28.643" end="01:28.905">you</span> <span begin="01:28.905" end="01:29.322">car</span><span begin="01:29.322" end="01:29.722">ry</span> <span begin="01:29.722" end="01:29.996">your</span> <span begin="01:29.996" end="01:30.781">e</span><span begin="01:30.781" end="01:31.045">ne</span><span begin="01:31.045" end="01:31.952">mies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而你背负着你所有的敌人</span></p><p begin="01:32.805" end="01:35.915" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:32.805" end="01:32.928">But</span> <span begin="01:32.928" end="01:33.212">they're</span> <span begin="01:33.212" end="01:33.741">so</span> <span begin="01:33.741" end="01:34.308">fa</span><span begin="01:34.308" end="01:34.842">mi</span><span begin="01:34.842" end="01:35.915">liar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但他们是那样似曾相识</span></p><p begin="01:37.211" end="01:40.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:37.211" end="01:37.455">I'm</span> <span begin="01:37.455" end="01:37.903">sick</span> <span begin="01:37.903" end="01:38.310">of</span> <span begin="01:38.310" end="01:38.555">the</span> <span begin="01:38.555" end="01:39.360">com</span><span begin="01:39.360" end="01:39.615">pa</span><span begin="01:39.615" end="01:40.207">ny</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我已经厌倦了陪伴</span></p><p begin="01:41.395" end="01:43.138" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:41.395" end="01:41.527">So</span> <span begin="01:41.527" end="01:41.775">I</span> <span begin="01:41.775" end="01:42.196">cull</span> <span begin="01:42.196" end="01:42.565">the</span> <span begin="01:42.565" end="01:43.138">shame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以也无所谓那些耻辱</span></p><p begin="01:44.056" end="01:47.958" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:44.056" end="01:44.158">And</span> <span begin="01:44.158" end="01:44.409">I</span> <span begin="01:44.409" end="01:44.677">know</span> <span begin="01:44.677" end="01:44.962">you'll</span> <span begin="01:44.962" end="01:45.558">say</span> <span begin="01:45.558" end="01:46.094">how</span> <span begin="01:46.094" end="01:46.602">I'm</span> <span begin="01:46.602" end="01:46.856">a</span> <span begin="01:46.856" end="01:47.443">bur</span><span begin="01:47.443" end="01:47.958">den</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而我知道 你觉得我是个沉重的累赘</span></p><p begin="01:48.458" end="01:52.136" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:48.458" end="01:48.727">Yeah</span> <span begin="01:48.727" end="01:49.017">do</span> <span begin="01:49.017" end="01:49.274">your</span> <span begin="01:49.274" end="01:49.803">worst</span> <span begin="01:49.803" end="01:50.892">all</span> <span begin="01:50.892" end="01:51.131">at</span> <span begin="01:51.131" end="01:52.136">once</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊 全部都一次性发泄出来吧</span></p><p begin="01:52.637" end="01:54.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:52.637" end="01:52.748">I</span> <span begin="01:52.748" end="01:53.010">know</span> <span begin="01:53.010" end="01:53.292">what</span> <span begin="01:53.292" end="01:53.580">you</span> <span begin="01:53.580" end="01:53.973">want</span> <span begin="01:53.973" end="01:54.371">from</span> <span begin="01:54.371" end="01:54.950">me</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:55.175" end="01:56.304"><span begin="01:55.175" end="01:55.580">(From</span> <span begin="01:55.580" end="01:56.304">me)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你想从我这里得到什么</span></p><p begin="01:56.949" end="01:58.740" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:56.949" end="01:57.053">I</span> <span begin="01:57.053" end="01:57.281">know</span> <span begin="01:57.281" end="01:57.587">what</span> <span begin="01:57.587" end="01:57.855">you're</span> <span begin="01:57.855" end="01:58.237">thin</span><span begin="01:58.237" end="01:58.740">king</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你怀揣着怎样的念想</span></p><p begin="02:01.302" end="02:05.367" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="02:01.302" end="02:01.362">And</span> <span begin="02:01.362" end="02:01.598">it's</span> <span begin="02:01.598" end="02:01.876">not</span> <span begin="02:01.876" end="02:02.145">the</span> <span begin="02:02.145" end="02:02.653">voice</span> <span begin="02:02.653" end="02:03.227">of</span> <span begin="02:03.227" end="02:03.758">all</span> <span begin="02:03.758" end="02:04.013">the</span> <span begin="02:04.013" end="02:04.547">o</span><span begin="02:04.547" end="02:05.367">thers</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而这些话语并非来自那尘世的喧嚣</span></p><p begin="02:05.602" end="02:09.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="02:05.602" end="02:05.880">You've</span> <span begin="02:05.880" end="02:06.161">on</span><span begin="02:06.161" end="02:06.445">ly</span> <span begin="02:06.445" end="02:06.972">said</span> <span begin="02:06.972" end="02:07.488">it</span> <span begin="02:07.488" end="02:07.902">to</span> <span begin="02:07.902" end="02:08.307">your</span><span begin="02:08.307" end="02:09.228">self</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你只对自己悄声呢喃过这些话</span></p><p begin="02:09.765" end="02:11.977" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:09.765" end="02:09.835">I</span> <span begin="02:09.835" end="02:10.095">know</span> <span begin="02:10.095" end="02:10.418">what</span> <span begin="02:10.418" end="02:10.720">you</span> <span begin="02:10.720" end="02:11.093">want</span> <span begin="02:11.093" end="02:11.510">from</span> <span begin="02:11.510" end="02:11.977">me</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:12.271" end="02:13.378"><span begin="02:12.271" end="02:12.690">(From</span> <span begin="02:12.690" end="02:13.378">me)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你想从我这里得到什么</span></p><p begin="02:14.060" end="02:15.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:14.060" end="02:14.160">I</span> <span begin="02:14.160" end="02:14.405">know</span> <span begin="02:14.405" end="02:14.700">what</span> <span begin="02:14.700" end="02:14.988">you're</span> <span begin="02:14.988" end="02:15.402">thin</span><span begin="02:15.402" end="02:15.950">king</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:15.950" end="02:18.900"><span begin="02:15.950" end="02:16.050">(They</span> <span begin="02:16.050" end="02:16.200">come</span> <span begin="02:16.200" end="02:16.405">to</span> <span begin="02:16.405" end="02:16.625">feel</span> <span begin="02:16.625" end="02:16.882">like</span> <span begin="02:16.882" end="02:17.290">things</span> <span begin="02:17.290" end="02:17.495">we're</span> <span begin="02:17.495" end="02:17.739">say</span><span begin="02:17.739" end="02:17.990">ing</span> <span begin="02:17.990" end="02:18.200">to</span> <span begin="02:18.200" end="02:18.278">our</span><span begin="02:18.278" end="02:18.900">selves)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那些话语 慢慢地变得像是我们的自说自话</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道你怀揣着怎样的念想</span></p><p begin="02:20.056" end="02:23.626" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="02:20.056" end="02:20.313">An</span> <span begin="02:20.313" end="02:20.766">inch</span> <span begin="02:20.766" end="02:21.160">from</span> <span begin="02:21.160" end="02:21.436">my</span> <span begin="02:21.436" end="02:22.248">ears</span> <span begin="02:22.248" end="02:22.503">a</span><span begin="02:22.503" end="02:23.626">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">又一次 距离我的耳畔近在咫尺</span></p><p begin="02:24.413" end="02:27.353" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:24.413" end="02:24.546">"You</span> <span begin="02:24.546" end="02:25.191">should</span> <span begin="02:25.191" end="02:25.686">be</span> <span begin="02:25.686" end="02:26.521">sor</span><span begin="02:26.521" end="02:27.353">ry"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“你应当对此感到抱歉”</span></p><p begin="02:28.649" end="02:30.369" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:28.649" end="02:28.870">A</span> <span begin="02:28.870" end="02:29.230">so</span><span begin="02:29.230" end="02:29.732">lemn</span> <span begin="02:29.732" end="02:30.369">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一个严肃的人</span></p><p begin="02:30.812" end="02:36.165" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:30.812" end="02:30.988">"A</span> <span begin="02:30.988" end="02:31.427">bet</span><span begin="02:31.427" end="02:31.880">ter</span> <span begin="02:31.880" end="02:32.454">song</span> <span begin="02:32.940" end="02:33.189">could</span> <span be